OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 3 JAN
OL,4,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,5,     GJools is joined by designer
OL,6,     GJasper Conran, with music by
OL,7,     GTelemann, Chopin and Ray Charles.
OL,8,G1300FMusic Matters: In the Beginning
OL,9,     GComposer James MacMillan explores
OL,10,     Gmusic inspired by the biblical
OL,11,     Gstory of creation.
OL,12,G1400FRecord Review
OL,13,     GThe best new classical releases
OL,14,     Gwith Andrew McGregor, joined by
OL,15,     GNigel Simeone and Tasmin Little,
OL,16,     Gwho picks her favourite recording
OL,17,     Gof Mozart's Sinfonia Concertante
OL,18,     Gin E flat K.364.
